.SS git-status
.nf
usage: distrodeck git-status [-h] {set,unset} ...

positional arguments:
  {set,unset}
    set        Enable git status prompt
    unset      Disable git status prompt

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
.fi
.SS git-aliases
.nf
usage: distrodeck git-aliases [-h] {set,unset,show} ...

positional arguments:
  {set,unset,show}
    set        Set recommended git aliases
    unset      Remove recommended git aliases
    show       Show recommended git aliases

options:
  -h, --help   show this help message and exit
.fi
.PP
Recommended aliases are prefixed with \fBd\fR (e.g., \fBgit df\fR, \fBgit dp\fR, \fBgit dl\fR, \fBgit dbr\fR, \fBgit dhelp\fR).
